      "comment": "Race 7 at Chelmsford City today is a Handicap (Class 5) for 3-year-olds and upwards over 1,408 m. The suggested wager is for the each way on the 4-year-old filly American Treasure from the Stuart Williams yard, and she will be ridden by Rossa Ryan. This daughter of U.S. Navy Flag came back from over a year off the track last time out, running a fair race. She will most likely improve today, going on the good form she showed on her first two starts, and rates as a main challenger here."
