      "napPerc": 0,
      "expertCount": 0,
      "commentCount": 3,
      "comment": "Showed promise in a couple of juvenile events and returned after an 8-month absence in a mile race at Kempton but was on her toes in the preliminaries and didn’t show her form. Improved on that effort at Newmarket next time despite not appearing to handle the track. It was a similar story at Lingfield last time when making her handicap debut from a mark of 71. She has been dropped 3 lbs by the handicapper as a result and back on the AW and on a flatter track is expected to bounce back and is worth a second look."
