      "comment": "Trainer John Joseph Murphy has a good chance here with The Dark Baron, who finished down the field under an extremely restrained ride over six furlongs at Roscommon when making his handicap debut last month. Today, he gets in here off a three lb lower and steps up to a mile for the first time, which should help, as should a more positive ride from stable jockey Joey Sheridan."
